<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>His Son, Jesus, is our Savior.</l><l>Once in human form He came.</l><l>Now as Spirit He can enter</l><l>As the breath of life to man.</l><l>As a seed within our spirit</l><l>Christ takes root and starts to grow,</l><l>Spreading in our inmost being</l><l>Till His life we come to know.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
